   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Houseguest** (1 review): Houseguest is played as the encore, after a crowd track [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **(Franklin Bruno enters, banter)**: back after 40 archived shows (742 days) [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2006-10-23.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 61 min; rated 4.5/5 by 4 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Franklin Bruno joins the band partway through the set, with some banter, as marked in the track list [2]\n- Darnielle talks between songs, often with stories or explanations; the reviewer wants that banter placed at the start of tracks, not the end [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2006-10-23.flac**: taped by Matt Meshulam; transferred by Matt Meshulam; source: 2x SM57 > Tascam 788 [1]. Also: Noise reduction was applied to the final mix; the reviewer warns it can strip out detail [4]",
